int or entrance gate, possibly a turnstile or automated door, with other people ahead of him. The lighting is dim, with blue and green LED indicators. This suggests a transition to a high-security or exclusive venue, such as a luxury hotel, private club, or upscale building.\n\n- **Frames 14-20:** The vlogger enters a grand, opulent lobby. The space is vast, with high ceilings, recessed lighting, and a polished black-and-white marble floor with geometric patterns. Tall, white columns line the space, and there are plush seating areas, decorative vases, and staff in formal attire. The ambiance is luxurious, quiet, and sophisticated. This is unmistakably the lobby of a **five-star hotel**, likely **The Ritz-Carlton Jakarta, Mega Kuningan**, known for its grand, modern, and elegant interior design.\n\n- **Transition:** The transition from the church to the hotel is marked by the vlogger passing through a security gate (Frames 11-13), which acts as a clear boundary between the public, historical space of the cathedral and the private, exclusive space of the hotel. The change in lighting, architecture, and atmosphere is stark: from the historic, spiritual, and open-air environment of the cathedral to the modern, luxurious, and enclosed environment of the hotel.\n\n---\n\n**3. Final Setting: Hotel Lounge or Room**\n\n- **Frames 21-25:** The vlogger is now seated in a comfortable, dimly lit lounge area within the hotel. The decor is modern and upscale, with plush sofas, low tables, and ambient lighting. He is speaking to the camera, gesturing as if explaining or narrating something. Other guests are visible in the background, relaxing on sofas.\n\n- **Frames 26-29:** The vlogger is holding a smartphone, showing the screen to the camera. The phone displays a ride-hailing app (likely Grab or Gojek), with a prompt asking “How was your ride?” and rating options. This suggests he is either concluding his day’s activities or preparing for his next destination.\n\n- **Transition:** There is no major architectural or environmental transition here; the vlogger remains within the hotel, moving from the grand lobby (Frames 14-20) to a more intimate lounge or seating area (Frames 21-25). The focus shifts from the grandeur of the space to a personal, interactive moment with the camera and his phone.\n\n---\n\n**Summary of Transitions and Settings:**\n\n- **Start:** Inside/entrance of Jakarta Cathedral (Gothic architecture, historic, spiritual).\n- **Transition 1:** Vlogger exits the cathedral, moves to the outdoor plaza, then transitions to a new location via a security checkpoint.\n- **New Location:** Enters a luxury hotel (The Ritz-Carlton Jakarta), characterized by modern, opulent design and high-end amenities.\n- **Final Scene:** Within the hotel’s lounge, the vlogger interacts with the camera and his phone, concluding the segment.\n\nThe video effectively captures a journey from a historic, cultural landmark to a modern, luxurious urban space, highlighting the contrast between Jakarta’s spiritual heritage and its contemporary, upscale lifestyle."}], 'formatted_responses': ["\n=== Batch 0-29 (29 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/tH_5YbklevQ/frames/frame_2200.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/tH_5YbklevQ/frames/frame_2201.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/tH_5YbklevQ/frames/frame_2206.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/tH_5YbklevQ/frames/frame_2207.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/tH_5YbklevQ/frames/frame_2209.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/tH_5YbklevQ/frames/frame_2210.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/tH_5YbklevQ/frames/frame_2254.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/tH_5YbklevQ/frames/frame_2256.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/tH_5YbklevQ/frames/frame_2263.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/tH_5YbklevQ/frames/frame_2265.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/tH_5YbklevQ/frames/frame_2513.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_